01:29:15,441 --> 01:29:16,971
-(Kumar screams)
-(Paathaalam groans)

1472
01:29:18,277 --> 01:29:19,311
(Prabha) <i>If he is such a big rowdy,</i>

1473
01:29:19,602 --> 01:29:21,980
how come no one knew about
Nagendran when I inquired?

1474
01:29:25,594 --> 01:29:26,628
That is the tricky part.

1475
01:29:27,130 --> 01:29:30,087
After the AC's murder,
his level went way up.

1476
01:29:33,565 --> 01:29:34,765
(Paathaalam howls in pain)

1477
01:29:36,747 --> 01:29:41,371
His circle, business, contacts,
everything changed. Even his name.

1478
01:29:41,751 --> 01:29:44,787
After he sent that man into the
deep end, his name is not Nagendran.

1479
01:29:45,135 --> 01:29:46,120
It's Paathaalam.

1480
01:29:53,745 --> 01:29:55,617
(Paathaalam growls in agony)

1481
01:29:58,889 --> 01:29:59,889
<i>Till now,</i>

1482
01:30:00,396 --> 01:30:04,529
no person who planned a hit
against Paathaalam has survived.

1483
01:30:12,025 --> 01:30:15,005
