within his jurisdiction,
he'll do what he wants.

1579
02:07:06,672 --> 02:07:08,360
-(thrashing)
-(man screams in pain)

1580
02:07:10,915 --> 02:07:13,815
-Hey, come!
-Sir, let me go. I'm innocent.

1581
02:07:14,708 --> 02:07:18,988
The whole world looks at us doubtfully
that the son will be like his dad.

1582
02:07:20,451 --> 02:07:21,838
(Prabha) <i>They've planned to kill
Veera and Kumar.</i>

1583
02:07:22,258 --> 02:07:24,598
They are young, sir,
save their lives at least.

1584
02:07:26,346 --> 02:07:27,286
(man) <i>Who the fuck is that lawyer,
anna?</i>

1585
02:07:27,560 --> 02:07:28,866
<i>He dares to help them surrender.</i>

1586
02:07:34,525 --> 02:07:36,093
(theme song plays)

1587
