-(indistinct chatter)
-(cheering)

1976
02:32:18,708 --> 02:32:19,774
-(boy) Do it, man!
-(referee whistles)

1977
02:32:20,801 --> 02:32:22,159
Welcome, <i>akka</i>.

1978
02:32:22,405 --> 02:32:24,151
-Hey, the coach I told you about.
-Hi, man.

1979
02:32:24,297 --> 02:32:25,245
Hello, coach.

1980
02:32:25,398 --> 02:32:26,618
-Running, right?
-Yes, coach.

1981
02:32:27,812 --> 02:32:29,230
Okay, sir, I will take care of him.

1982
02:32:29,517 --> 02:32:32,176
