between you and advocate Prabhakaran.

1986
02:32:56,335 --> 02:32:59,799
(suspenseful music)

1987
02:33:18,994 --> 02:33:21,623
(music turns sinister)

1988
02:33:30,744 --> 02:33:31,858
(music halts)

1989
