1990
02:33:40,530 --> 02:33:41,480
What is that?

1991
02:33:41,707 --> 02:33:43,538
-FIR.
-Oh.

1992
02:33:43,707 --> 02:33:45,037
What is the case?

1993
02:33:45,313 --> 02:33:47,161
It seems there was a complaint
filed with the bar council.

1994
02:33:48,107 --> 02:33:51,947
Murder, surrender, juvenile home,
I'm hearing so many things. (chuckles)

1995
02:33:52,918 --> 02:33:54,645
Apparently, only if the goalkeeper
comes and gives his testimony,

1996
02:33:54,780 --> 02:33:56,271
