1997
02:33:57,912 --> 02:33:58,848
What do you want?

1998
02:34:01,455 --> 02:34:03,361
Did you kill so that
the truth will not come out?

1999
02:34:04,175 --> 02:34:05,175
Paathaalam, I mean.

2000
02:34:06,314 --> 02:34:07,385
Huh?

2001
02:34:10,328 --> 02:34:11,374
(paper rustles)

2002
02:34:14,443 --> 02:34:17,483
You were one of the five boys
who committed murder that day.

2003
02:34:19,963 --> 02:34:23,910
To bring you out, the goalkeeper
Nagendran took the money and went in.

2004
02:34:24,552 --> 02:34:26,243
That Nagendran is

2005
02:34:26,310 --> 02:34:29,598
Paathaalam, which you found out
with the help of Inspector Muthuvel.

2006
02:34:29,820 --> 02:34:32,993
If he tells the truth, you might not
be able to become a judge.

2007
02:34:33,473 --> 02:34:37,040
So, with the help of Veera and Kumar,
who you have already saved,

2008
02:34:37,353 --> 02:34:38,526
you got Paathaalam killed.

2009
02:34:41,580 --> 02:34:43,193
So unlike what everyone thinks,

2010
02:34:43,553 --> 02:34:45,013
this is not a murder
done for Label.

2011
02:34:47,380 --> 02:34:49,046
It was done so that
you could become a Label.

2012
02:34:51,467 --> 02:34:52,493
I'm sure you know that,

2013
02:34:52,627 --> 02:34:53,593
more than the killer himself,

2014
02:34:53,907 --> 02:34:55,686
the person who aided and abetted
the murder gets the higher punishment.

2015
02:34:55,929 --> 02:34:56,891
So,

2016
02:34:57,023 --> 02:34:59,890
you are A1 now, and we have
restarted the investigation.

2017
02:35:03,143 --> 02:35:05,403
It is customary to convey
good news in person.

2018
02:35:05,963 --> 02:35:08,156
I thought I will tell you now
