-Tell him to meet me a week before.
-Sir.

2041
02:38:44,545 --> 02:38:45,677
I wish to surrender.

2042
02:38:46,109 --> 02:38:48,037
-Go and meet the writer.
-Okay, sir.

2043
02:38:48,314 --> 02:38:49,703
Tell him to meet me tomorrow.

2044
02:38:50,307 --> 02:38:51,919
(suspenseful music)

2045
02:38:54,780 --> 02:38:55,823
Tell me.

2046
02:38:56,092 --> 02:38:57,212
What's the case?

2047
02:38:59,207 --> 02:39:00,423
Murder, sir.

2048
02:39:00,889 --> 02:39:03,092
Who's the victim, and how did you
kill him? Give me the details.

2049
02:39:04,324 --> 02:39:06,736
He killed my <i>anna</i> six months ago.

2050
02:39:06,983 --> 02:39:08,223
So, I finished him off.

2051
02:39:08,585 --> 02:39:10,492
Revenge?
Whom did you murder?

2052
02:39:11,192 --> 02:39:14,154
Sir, two men are surrendering
