<i>Yes, sir.</i>

2064
02:39:46,737 --> 02:39:49,022
<i>Okay, keep them in the station.
I'll let you know what to do.</i>

2065
02:39:49,055 --> 02:39:50,251
Okay, sir.

2066
02:39:52,402 --> 02:39:54,463
Sir, they went to R2.

2067
02:39:54,483 --> 02:39:56,543
