2068
02:39:56,613 --> 02:39:57,642
Arul Kumaran, sir.

2069
02:39:57,645 --> 02:39:59,153
-Tell him to meet me right now.
-Okay, sir.

2070
02:39:59,313 --> 02:40:00,833
(siren wailing)

2071
