2082
02:40:26,079 --> 02:40:28,367
Will you be able to follow
the lead now?

2083
02:40:29,217 --> 02:40:30,946
No. Both of them have been murdered.

2084
02:40:31,487 --> 02:40:32,607
Label case.

2085
02:40:35,534 --> 02:40:39,179
So there's no evidence against them
other than the confession, right?

2086
02:40:40,921 --> 02:40:42,041
There's none, sir.

2087
02:40:42,750 --> 02:40:44,633
(suspenseful music)

2088
02:40:50,199 --> 02:40:51,388
(policeman) Sir!

2089
02:40:52,115 --> 02:40:53,554
(rousing music)

2090
02:41:01,307 --> 02:41:03,176
(background chatter)

2091
